WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:39.050
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:39.320 --> 01:41.490
[Episode 32]

3
01:53.459 --> 01:55.560
Isn't that Jiang Xue Ting from the Secretariat?

4
01:55.560 --> 01:57.200
Why would he be here?

5
02:04.600 --> 02:06.060
Deputy Commander Yu.

6
02:08.200 --> 02:09.700
Deputy Commander Yu.

7
02:11.500 --> 02:14.560
Commissioner Gao, what an honor. Forgive us for not greeting you sooner.

8
02:14.560 --> 02:16.039
My father is on patrol at the North Harbor.

9
02:16.039 --> 02:18.879
He asked us to make sure you're well looked after.

10
02:18.879 --> 02:20.039
Deputy Commander Yu.

11
02:20.039 --> 02:21.740
You're too kind.

12
02:21.740 --> 02:25.039
Your father really does handle everything himself.

13
02:25.039 --> 02:30.599
With you and your father holding Nanhuai now, the Central Government can rest easy.

14
02:31.280 --> 02:32.879
Let me make the introductions.

15
02:32.879 --> 02:37.379
This is Jiang Xue Ting, the new Director of the Interior Ministry.

16
02:37.379 --> 02:40.419
This is his fiancée, Miss Tao.

17
02:40.419 --> 02:42.840
Director Jiang is a rising star.

18
02:42.840 --> 02:46.300
He now runs the Interior Ministry's Propaganda Department.

19
02:46.300 --> 02:52.380
Every newspaper and radio station in the Central Government answers to him.

20
02:55.000 --> 02:56.740
It's been a long time.

21
02:56.740 --> 02:58.180
Deputy Commander Yu.

22
03:00.960 --> 03:03.580
You two already know each other?

23
03:03.580 --> 03:07.819
Years ago, I served under you, Deputy Commander Yu.

24
03:07.819 --> 03:13.120
I've never forgotten what you taught me.

25
03:15.800 --> 03:16.960
What's more,

26
03:18.040 --> 03:24.040
your wife and I were neighbors who grew up together.

27
03:27.020 --> 03:31.340
And my fiancée, Tao Zi Yi, is Lady Ping Jun's younger sister.

28
03:33.680 --> 03:35.020
So,

29
03:35.020 --> 03:38.640
Deputy Commander Yu and Director Jiang are brothers-in-law.

30
03:38.640 --> 03:40.661
Who would have guessed!

31
03:42.760 --> 03:46.520
When you left Nanhuai, we never heard from you again.

32
03:46.520 --> 03:49.099
I never expected you to rise so high.

33
03:49.099 --> 03:53.319
You've become the prized son-in-law of both the Tao and Tang families.

34
03:54.379 --> 03:56.860
You clearly have real talent.

35
03:59.160 --> 04:02.646
In this life, you always have to aim higher.

36
04:03.560 --> 04:07.953
That's the only way to see farther and find a better view.

37
04:13.099 --> 04:14.340
Sister.

38
04:17.040 --> 04:21.180
I heard you had an accident two years ago and you've been unwell ever since.

39
04:21.180 --> 04:23.180
I wanted to come see you.

40
04:23.180 --> 04:26.759
But Xue Ting has just been so busy.

41
04:26.759 --> 04:28.139
It's fine.

42
04:28.139 --> 04:30.699
Chang Xuan has mentioned you.

43
04:41.760 --> 04:45.800
Commissioner Gao. The Southern Revolutionary Army's Northern Expedition is advancing fast.

44
04:45.800 --> 04:47.960
They've already taken Changsha and Wuhan.

45
04:47.960 --> 04:50.160
They're marching on the northern strongholds.

46
04:50.160 --> 04:53.320
May I ask how the Central Government sees this?

47
04:53.320 --> 04:57.480
This so-called Northern Expedition is nothing but armed rebellion.

48
04:57.480 --> 05:01.044
The rebels set up a rival government in Guangzhou.

49
05:01.044 --> 05:04.180
That is an attempt to divide the nation.

50
05:04.180 --> 05:10.160
The Central Government is the sole lawful seat of power in the Republic of China.

51
05:10.160 --> 05:15.879
We will show no mercy to anyone who tries to divide the nation.

52
05:15.879 --> 05:20.160
- Good. - Good.

53
05:20.160 --> 05:24.540
We've read a few articles in your government's Current Affairs Daily.

54
05:24.540 --> 05:27.620
They hint that certain military dynasties with deep roots

55
05:27.620 --> 05:31.899
don't quite see eye to eye with the Central Government.

56
05:39.640 --> 05:44.806
As soldiers, we have a sacred duty to guard the land and protect the people.

57
05:44.806 --> 05:49.240
The stability of Nanhuai and the livelihood of its people

58
05:49.240 --> 05:52.303
are the heaviest burden on the Yu Army's shoulders.

59
05:52.303 --> 05:57.800
Whatever the situation, a soldier must hold that above all.

60
05:57.800 --> 06:04.320
I believe the Central Government sees this exactly as we do.

61
06:04.320 --> 06:07.360
- Good. - Good.

62
06:07.360 --> 06:09.619
Deputy Commander Yu, could you elaborate?

63
06:16.392 --> 06:20.760
- Could you elaborate? Deputy Commander Yu. - Could you give me a straight answer?

64
06:20.760 --> 06:23.379
Deputy Commander Yu. I have a few more questions for you.

65
06:23.379 --> 06:25.180
Please answer directly.

66
06:25.180 --> 06:26.660
Yes, say something.

67
06:27.240 --> 06:28.639
Where did Ping Jun go?

68
06:28.639 --> 06:31.139
I think she went to the east garden.

69
06:33.040 --> 06:35.473
Deputy Commander Yu, a moment, please.

70
06:39.360 --> 06:40.680
Deputy Commander.

71
06:40.680 --> 06:45.280
I just saw the Yu Army's guards. Every one of them looks sharp and alert.

72
06:45.280 --> 06:48.364
Your troops are impeccably drilled and brimming with fighting spirit.

73
06:48.364 --> 06:49.959
You flatter me.

74
06:49.959 --> 06:53.306
They're just local Nanhuai boys, drilled a little harder, that's all.

75
06:54.280 --> 06:57.120
With you here, Nanhuai is impregnable.

76
06:57.120 --> 07:02.198
It's just that this mighty army only answers to the Yu family.

77
07:02.198 --> 07:04.290
They don't recognize the Central Government.

78
07:04.290 --> 07:07.031
Is that a blessing or a curse?

79
07:10.760 --> 07:12.760
You're joking.

80
07:12.760 --> 07:14.875
Every soldier in the Yu Army,

81
07:14.875 --> 07:18.824
from the day they enlist, is taught to be loyal to the nation.

82
07:18.824 --> 07:23.384
That has never changed, under my father or under me.

83
07:25.880 --> 07:27.844
I was only joking.

84
07:27.844 --> 07:28.960
Good.

85
07:28.960 --> 07:32.897
Hearing you say that puts my mind at ease.

86
07:32.897 --> 07:34.760
Let's go find somewhere to have a drink.

87
07:34.760 --> 07:38.520
Commissioner Gao, you've had a long journey. Why not get some rest tonight?

88
07:38.520 --> 07:40.480
I still have some friends from the embassy waiting for me.

89
07:40.480 --> 07:41.740
Bo Ren.

90
07:41.740 --> 07:44.004
Show Commissioner Gao to a seat and bring out the best whiskey.

91
07:44.004 --> 07:46.400
Leave it to me. Commissioner Gao, this way, please.

92
07:46.400 --> 07:48.640
All right.

93
07:48.640 --> 07:49.826
Come.

94
07:51.939 --> 07:53.240
Chang Xuan.

95
07:53.240 --> 07:56.959
After Jiang Xue Ting disappeared back then, there was no word of him at all.

96
07:56.959 --> 07:59.660
In just six months, he became Tao Zi Yi's fiancé.

97
07:59.660 --> 08:03.120
- Backing him was not only Tang Ji Shan-- - But Mou Lin Sen as well.

98
08:03.120 --> 08:04.680
Yes.

99
08:04.680 --> 08:08.180
It was Mou Lin Sen who put him forward as Interior Ministry Director.

100
08:09.600 --> 08:12.660
Rui Tong, I need you to do something for me.

101
08:15.000 --> 08:16.180
Ping Jun.

102
08:20.240 --> 08:21.841
We finally meet again.

103
08:22.939 --> 08:24.360
Director Jiang.

104
08:26.079 --> 08:27.680
Is there something you need?

105
08:29.160 --> 08:30.560
Ping Jun.

106
08:30.560 --> 08:33.064
Take a good look at me.

107
08:33.064 --> 08:35.320
Do you really not remember anything?

108
08:35.320 --> 08:37.320
What are you doing? Let go of me.

109
08:44.840 --> 08:47.320
I'm sorry.

110
08:47.320 --> 08:48.779
Don't be afraid of me.

111
08:48.779 --> 08:51.039
It's just been so long since I saw you.

112
08:52.760 --> 08:54.759
Ping Jun, do you really not remember anything?

113
08:54.759 --> 08:56.799
We grew up together.

114
08:56.799 --> 08:58.500
Then I left for Japan.

115
08:59.440 --> 09:01.379
We wrote to each other every week.

116
09:03.139 --> 09:07.500
Four whole years. One hundred and forty-three letters.

117
09:07.500 --> 09:09.360
I kept every single one.

118
09:09.980 --> 09:14.940
We had promised we'd get married right after graduation.

119
09:19.500 --> 09:21.659
What did Xue Ting say in his letters?

120
09:23.240 --> 09:26.760
He said he was doing fine and he'd be back in the fall.

121
09:38.080 --> 09:39.379
Director Jiang.

122
09:40.419 --> 09:42.700
No matter what happened between us before,

123
09:43.600 --> 09:47.300
Chang Xuan and I are married now.

124
09:48.640 --> 09:51.000
It's all settled.

125
09:51.000 --> 09:53.360
We should keep our distance.

126
09:53.360 --> 09:55.080
What do you mean, settled?

127
09:55.080 --> 09:58.056
You think you and Yu Chang Xuan fell in love and it all came naturally?

128
09:58.056 --> 09:59.880
To get you, he had me thrown in prison.

129
09:59.880 --> 10:02.679
He threatened you with my life and locked you up in Maple Mansion.

130
10:02.679 --> 10:06.580
He only let me go because you threatened to kill yourself.

131
10:10.200 --> 10:14.840
That scar is from when you slit your wrist back then.

132
10:32.320 --> 10:33.766
That's impossible.

133
10:35.240 --> 10:36.946
He's not that kind of man.

134
10:44.559 --> 10:46.700
He's not that kind of man?

135
10:48.559 --> 10:52.539
He's nothing but a liar through and through.

136
10:52.539 --> 10:54.799
He used your amnesia to steal you away.

137
10:55.940 --> 10:59.100
He cheated his way into everything that was never his to begin with.

138
11:03.840 --> 11:05.280
Director Jiang.

139
11:06.800 --> 11:08.586
I did lose my memory.

140
11:09.560 --> 11:11.920
But I haven't lost my judgment.

141
11:13.720 --> 11:19.713
I can judge for myself what kind of man my husband is.

142
11:25.059 --> 11:26.200
Is that so?

143
11:30.800 --> 11:35.760
Then did he tell you how your mother died?

144
11:39.960 --> 11:41.600
What do you mean?

145
11:44.860 --> 11:48.820
Back when we made up our minds to leave Nanhuai with your mother,

146
11:49.475 --> 11:51.880
Yu Chang Xuan hunted us relentlessly.

147
11:51.880 --> 11:55.740
A fire mysteriously broke out at the place we were staying.

148
11:55.740 --> 11:57.440
You and I barely escaped.

149
11:57.440 --> 11:58.700
But your mother...

150
12:00.259 --> 12:01.759
Your mother...

151
12:05.159 --> 12:07.620
She died in that fire.

152
12:15.240 --> 12:16.500
That's impossible.

153
12:18.299 --> 12:20.200
Absolutely impossible.

154
12:20.200 --> 12:21.620
Why would he do that?

155
12:21.620 --> 12:27.040
Because that fire dug up the truth about your past.

156
12:27.040 --> 12:31.070
You never wanted to marry him, let alone have feelings for him.

157
12:31.070 --> 12:36.294
He hid all of this just to create the illusion that you two were in love.

158
12:36.294 --> 12:37.626
Director Jiang.

159
12:53.280 --> 12:57.339
Director Jiang, there you are. I've been looking everywhere for you.

160
13:00.139 --> 13:01.639
Deputy Commander Yu.

161
13:03.179 --> 13:04.940
You got here fast.

162
13:05.740 --> 13:08.019
Are you that afraid I'll expose your lies?

163
13:08.019 --> 13:09.320
Director Jiang.

164
13:10.760 --> 13:12.746
Mind your place.

165
13:13.720 --> 13:15.960
Stay away from my wife.

166
13:15.960 --> 13:17.446
Your wife?

167
13:18.480 --> 13:20.680
Can you say that with a straight face?

168
13:21.960 --> 13:26.066
Which part of what I just said was a lie?

169
13:34.280 --> 13:36.264
So this is where you all are.

170
13:36.264 --> 13:38.024
You seem to be having quite the chat.

171
13:42.760 --> 13:44.733
Without me, no less.

172
13:46.200 --> 13:49.065
Chang Xuan, do you remember?

173
13:49.065 --> 13:53.779
Back when you broke up with me, you said you weren't good enough for me.

174
13:53.779 --> 13:59.440
You also said I'd find a man one day who truly loved me and deserved me.

175
14:02.040 --> 14:03.860
And I really did.

176
14:04.679 --> 14:05.800
Chang Xuan.

177
14:05.800 --> 14:08.517
I have you to thank for letting me go back then.

178
14:08.517 --> 14:13.816
Otherwise, Xue Ting and I wouldn't be where we are today.

179
15:05.680 --> 15:09.881
Ask whatever you want to know.

180
15:11.920 --> 15:17.626
If I ask, will you tell me the truth?

181
15:20.120 --> 15:21.226
Yes.

182
15:30.600 --> 15:33.419
You were once engaged to Tao Zi Yi.

183
15:35.519 --> 15:41.740
And Jiang Xue Ting was once my fiancé.

184
15:45.440 --> 15:46.739
Yes.

185
15:55.139 --> 15:57.160
You had him thrown in prison

186
15:58.760 --> 16:03.780
and threatened his life to make me stay with you.

187
16:08.120 --> 16:09.440
Yes.

188
16:22.520 --> 16:24.099
And my mother?

189
16:28.139 --> 16:30.259
It wasn't a relapse of her old illness.

190
16:35.480 --> 16:38.620
She died in that fire at the harbor.

191
16:51.139 --> 16:52.419
Yes.

192
16:56.520 --> 16:57.920
I lied to you.

193
17:03.600 --> 17:04.920
Ping Jun.

194
17:04.920 --> 17:06.279
Don't touch me.

195
17:13.559 --> 17:14.920
Yu Chang Xuan.

196
17:15.880 --> 17:18.280
You had so many chances to tell me the truth.

197
17:18.280 --> 17:20.159
Why didn't you?

198
17:21.660 --> 17:25.740
You let me live like a fool inside the lies you spun.

199
17:26.660 --> 17:29.680
Because of a little kindness you showed me,

200
17:31.420 --> 17:32.933
you made me waver.

201
17:34.200 --> 17:35.973
You made me feel guilty.

202
17:37.520 --> 17:39.180
That fire...

203
17:40.759 --> 17:45.680
I really never expected an accident like that.

204
17:47.160 --> 17:51.700
I was selfish. I didn't want to lose you.

205
17:53.440 --> 17:56.113
That's why I resorted to such despicable means

206
17:59.320 --> 18:01.641
to steal these two years.

207
18:05.760 --> 18:07.179
Yu Chang Xuan.

208
18:10.600 --> 18:12.821
So the two of us...

209
18:15.880 --> 18:17.941
never loved each other at all.

210
18:19.400 --> 18:20.513
Is that right?

211
18:34.240 --> 18:35.960
Everything between us...

212
18:41.019 --> 18:43.859
Everything was all a lie.

213
18:46.579 --> 18:47.859
Wasn't it?

214
19:13.559 --> 19:14.859
Leave.

215
19:18.980 --> 19:20.940
I don't want to see you again.

216
19:23.940 --> 19:25.259
I'm sorry.

217
19:27.259 --> 19:29.660
I know I have no right to keep you.

218
19:31.720 --> 19:34.401
So whatever you decide in the end,

219
19:35.840 --> 19:39.006
whether you go or stay,

220
19:43.040 --> 19:44.859
I won't stand in your way.

221
21:41.079 --> 21:42.200
Jin.

222
21:45.873 --> 21:47.153
Perfect timing.

223
21:48.400 --> 21:49.900
Get me two more bottles.

224
21:51.760 --> 21:54.980
Master Chang Xuan, you can't drink any more.

225
22:19.440 --> 22:21.759
Don't try to stop me today.

226
22:24.920 --> 22:26.241
Understand?

227
22:36.880 --> 22:38.180
I lost.

228
22:40.080 --> 22:46.386
How can love be judged by winning or losing?

229
23:01.800 --> 23:05.006
I've left the choice entirely up to Ping Jun.

230
23:08.319 --> 23:10.506
Whatever she decides,

231
23:12.960 --> 23:14.960
I can't go back on my word.

232
23:28.640 --> 23:31.200
Did you hear about the Little West House?

233
23:31.200 --> 23:35.920
Last night, Master Chang Xuan and Lady Ping Jun returned looking terribly grim.

234
23:35.920 --> 23:37.240
Yes.

235
23:37.240 --> 23:40.779
Xiao Mei from the Little West House said they had a terrible fight.

236
23:40.779 --> 23:44.440
Then Master Chang Xuan left and didn't come back all night.

237
23:44.440 --> 23:46.619
Miss Tao came back yesterday.

238
23:46.619 --> 23:49.359
She even brought along a fiancé surnamed Jiang.

239
23:49.359 --> 23:51.859
That fiancé was Lady Ping Jun's former--

240
23:51.859 --> 23:55.940
We brought you here to work, not to gossip.

241
23:55.940 --> 23:57.213
- Miss Jin Xuan. - Miss Jin Xuan.

242
24:05.240 --> 24:07.319
Then I'll get straight to the point.

243
24:07.319 --> 24:09.480
Starting today,

244
24:09.480 --> 24:14.059
the Central Government has appointed me to take over this Arsenal.

245
24:14.059 --> 24:17.960
The two of you are to gather all technical drawings,

246
24:17.960 --> 24:20.200
patent documents, and personnel rosters.

247
24:20.200 --> 24:21.760
Hand them over immediately.

248
24:23.740 --> 24:26.200
Commissioner Gao, with all due respect,

249
24:26.200 --> 24:31.240
everyone here has been formally registered as military personnel since they joined.

250
24:31.240 --> 24:33.240
We have our own chain of command.

251
24:33.240 --> 24:37.119
We are soldiers. We can't just be placed under your authority.

252
24:39.519 --> 24:40.559
What do you mean?

253
24:40.559 --> 24:46.400
Any personnel transfer requires a formal order from the Ministry of Military Affairs.

254
24:46.400 --> 24:49.560
Redesignating our entire factory

255
24:49.560 --> 24:52.978
is not something a verbal order can accomplish.

256
24:52.978 --> 24:54.538
I'm afraid I can't comply.

257
24:55.480 --> 24:56.759
Commissioner Gao,

258
24:56.759 --> 25:00.840
our contract was signed with Deputy Commander Yu personally.

259
25:00.840 --> 25:02.664
We work for him.

260
25:02.664 --> 25:06.759
Under the contract, if the employer changes,

261
25:06.759 --> 25:10.859
we have the right to terminate our service at once and return to Germany.

262
25:10.859 --> 25:14.079
We may also demand full compensation.

263
25:15.619 --> 25:18.680
Yu Chang Xuan, don't pull that with me.

264
25:18.680 --> 25:21.259
You've turned the technicians into your family's own soldiers.

265
25:21.259 --> 25:23.319
You signed such contracts with foreigners.

266
25:23.319 --> 25:26.960
You're clearly building a private army and plotting something.

267
25:28.019 --> 25:30.059
That's a bit harsh.

268
25:30.059 --> 25:32.480
- We're simply following the rules. - You!

269
25:32.480 --> 25:37.500
Commissioner Gao, there's no need to get worked up.

270
25:46.480 --> 25:50.660
It seems the details of the handover are a bit more complicated than I expected.

271
25:50.660 --> 25:52.440
But the contracts can be renegotiated.

272
25:52.440 --> 25:56.400
And the registration can go through a special approval process.

273
25:56.400 --> 25:58.839
As for the problems, there's always a way to solve them.

274
25:58.839 --> 26:01.319
Right, Deputy Commander Yu?

275
26:03.320 --> 26:05.120
Of course.

276
26:05.120 --> 26:06.341
Good.

277
26:06.980 --> 26:09.559
Then I'll give you one week, Deputy Commander Yu.

278
26:09.559 --> 26:15.119
By then, you'll have the staffing and the foreigners' contracts all sorted out.

279
26:15.119 --> 26:21.260
If anything is still amiss, I will report it to the Central Government.

280
26:30.960 --> 26:33.546
That's it? Call that an inspection?

281
26:33.546 --> 26:35.800
That's daylight robbery.

282
26:35.800 --> 26:38.093
They will not let this go.

283
26:51.400 --> 26:52.700
Coming.

284
27:06.080 --> 27:09.320
Ping Jun, can we talk?

285
27:12.937 --> 27:18.415
[Yu's Mansion]

286
28:58.019 --> 28:59.319
Jin Xuan.

287
29:01.560 --> 29:03.313
Ping Jun's already gone.

288
29:04.080 --> 29:06.166
She bought a boat ticket to Guangzhou.

289
29:12.319 --> 29:17.180
You had the courage to make the mistake. Why don't you dare face it now?

290
29:22.079 --> 29:25.559
Any later, and the boat will have sailed.

291
29:48.560 --> 29:50.080
Slow down.

292
29:52.918 --> 29:55.710
[Pingpu Wharf]

293
31:27.520 --> 31:29.966
I thought you would really leave me.

294
31:31.200 --> 31:35.900
Yes. I should have left you.

295
31:37.980 --> 31:42.400
But once I got on the boat, I suddenly realized

296
31:47.220 --> 31:48.980
I couldn't bear to.

297
31:57.160 --> 32:00.440
The doctors said you might never wake up.

298
32:00.440 --> 32:02.440
But Master Chang Xuan insisted on marrying you.

299
32:02.440 --> 32:05.560
He even told his father that even if you never woke up,

300
32:05.560 --> 32:07.473
he would care for you for life.

301
32:08.220 --> 32:12.980
Look. He set up his bed right beside yours so he could look after you.

302
32:14.480 --> 32:18.706
Let's stay together for the rest of our lives, all right?

303
32:19.680 --> 32:22.773
You can't take that back. Not for the rest of your life.

304
32:23.440 --> 32:25.760
When you woke up at Maple Mansion,

305
32:25.760 --> 32:30.440
the doctors warned us again and again never to let anything upset you.

306
32:30.440 --> 32:34.890
Especially not to bring up the painful parts of your past.

307
32:34.890 --> 32:37.880
Chang Xuan was afraid you'd remember the past.

308
32:37.880 --> 32:40.753
What he did was selfish, yes.

309
32:41.400 --> 32:45.260
Back then, he did not know how to love someone.

310
32:46.480 --> 32:48.079
But, Ping Jun.

311
32:48.079 --> 32:51.280
He really is changing because of you.

312
32:51.280 --> 32:56.370
Maybe you don't remember when Chang Xuan was framed for colluding with the Japanese.

313
32:56.370 --> 32:58.289
You stood up for him,

314
32:58.289 --> 33:01.680
and from start to finish, you believed in him and backed him.

315
33:02.280 --> 33:08.766
I could tell, even back then, he was already in your heart.

316
33:22.320 --> 33:23.900
You hurt me.

317
33:27.040 --> 33:28.773
You lied to me too.

318
33:29.759 --> 33:35.039
We started off in the worst possible way.

319
33:36.680 --> 33:39.680
But now I understand clearly

320
33:39.680 --> 33:44.000
what kind of person you are today.

321
33:44.660 --> 33:46.539
And I understand even better

322
33:47.680 --> 33:52.519
what we feel for each other right now.

323
33:57.359 --> 33:59.099
That's enough.

324
34:05.279 --> 34:06.700
I'm sorry.

325
34:08.800 --> 34:14.460
I'm sorry for my past lies and selfishness.

326
34:18.539 --> 34:19.860
Thank you.

327
34:21.920 --> 34:23.920
Thank you for still giving me a chance.

328
34:26.720 --> 34:28.499
Promise me.

329
34:30.000 --> 34:32.146
From now on,

330
34:34.200 --> 34:36.200
no more lying to me.

331
34:37.559 --> 34:39.600
And never let me down again.

332
34:49.159 --> 34:54.880
I swear I will never lie to you again.

333
34:56.960 --> 34:58.639
I will never let you down.

334
35:05.000 --> 35:06.640
Let's go home.

335
35:16.760 --> 35:18.059
All right.

336
35:20.040 --> 35:21.540
Let's go home.

337
35:54.000 --> 35:55.653
Yu Chang Xuan.

338
35:56.320 --> 35:58.679
He dares to play tricks on me.

339
35:59.679 --> 36:00.739
Division Commander.

340
36:00.739 --> 36:03.699
Yu Chang Xuan is just too young.

341
36:03.699 --> 36:07.559
He's out of his depth, daring to challenge you.

342
36:07.559 --> 36:11.099
He wants to run Nanhuai like his own kingdom.

343
36:12.320 --> 36:13.659
Just wait.

344
36:13.659 --> 36:17.739
Once I report to the Central Government, he'll be on his knees begging me.

345
36:17.739 --> 36:18.960
Exactly.

346
36:18.960 --> 36:21.100
- Come on, drink up. - Cheers, Division Commander.

347
36:23.840 --> 36:25.800
Take care, Sir.

348
36:27.199 --> 36:28.559
Take care, Sir.

349
36:28.559 --> 36:30.059
Come again.

350
36:33.559 --> 36:34.940
Take care.

351
36:36.080 --> 36:37.613
Do come again.

352
37:10.679 --> 37:14.099
Director Jiang, what can I do for you?

353
37:22.800 --> 37:24.800
Deputy Commander Yu.

354
37:24.800 --> 37:30.240
Last night, Division Commander Gao was killed in the street.

355
37:30.240 --> 37:32.579
Are you aware of this?

356
37:32.579 --> 37:36.519
I just got word. I was about to seal the city and launch a full investigation.

357
37:36.519 --> 37:39.039
I will bring the killer to justice.

358
37:41.340 --> 37:43.519
No need to go to the trouble.

359
37:43.519 --> 37:46.940
The killer is right here.

360
37:48.480 --> 37:52.120
Jiang Xue Ting, what do you mean by that?

361
37:53.280 --> 37:55.480
We've already caught the killer.

362
37:55.480 --> 37:59.400
Under harsh interrogation, he confessed.

363
37:59.400 --> 38:01.680
He was acting on your orders.

364
38:01.680 --> 38:03.484
That's nonsense!

365
38:03.484 --> 38:06.320
You grab some random guy and try to frame him?

366
38:15.200 --> 38:17.559
I've already reported this to the Central Government.

367
38:17.559 --> 38:20.860
This is an emergency arrest warrant from the Military Commission.

368
38:28.600 --> 38:32.381
Deputy Commander Yu, you'd better come with us.

369
38:33.000 --> 38:35.000
Go ahead and try.

370
38:51.940 --> 38:53.380
What are you doing?

371
38:56.600 --> 38:59.377
My orders today are to arrest you alone.

372
38:59.377 --> 39:04.118
If you surrender, you alone will bear the consequences.

373
39:07.160 --> 39:12.170
If you resist arrest, that's outright armed rebellion.

374
39:12.170 --> 39:17.649
Then your entire Yu Army will be treated as rebels.

375
39:18.480 --> 39:19.980
Think it over.

376
39:42.200 --> 39:43.606
Rui Tong.

377
39:44.280 --> 39:46.900
Inform the Commander-in-Chief.

378
39:46.900 --> 39:51.200
Headquarters carries on as usual. Keep the troops steady.

379
39:51.200 --> 39:52.433
Yes, sir.

380
39:58.739 --> 39:59.980
I'll go with you.

381
40:23.600 --> 40:24.861
What are you looking at?

382
40:25.520 --> 40:26.960
I really want to...

383
40:56.320 --> 40:58.313
[Sujing Army Prison]

384
41:11.920 --> 41:13.221
Open the door.

385
41:21.260 --> 41:22.380
Chang Xuan.

386
41:23.600 --> 41:24.760
Father.

387
41:29.200 --> 41:30.626
Are you all right?

388
41:32.040 --> 41:34.120
Did they give you a hard time?

389
41:34.120 --> 41:36.301
I'm fine. Don't worry.

390
41:38.329 --> 41:44.253
Jiang Xue Ting's first move as Director of the Interior Ministry was to go after you.

391
41:44.826 --> 41:50.089
They want to use our arsenal as a political tool for the Central Government.

392
41:50.089 --> 41:51.089
That is one reason.

393
41:52.139 --> 41:53.659
There's something else.

394
41:55.239 --> 41:58.880
This may have something to do with Ye Ping Jun.

395
41:58.880 --> 42:03.199
I'd already let the Tao Xi Li matter go.

396
42:03.199 --> 42:05.900
But Jiang Xue Ting is coming after you.

397
42:05.900 --> 42:10.860
Is this grudge because of Ye Ping Jun?

398
42:10.860 --> 42:11.980
Father.

399
42:15.079 --> 42:19.240
I was the one who insisted on keeping Ping Jun by my side.

400
42:19.240 --> 42:21.260
I was the one who couldn't let her go.

401
42:21.260 --> 42:25.079
Jiang Xue Ting hates me, and I'm the one he's taking revenge on.

402
42:25.079 --> 42:29.239
Ping Jun has already suffered far too much for things she never did.

403
42:29.239 --> 42:32.820
You can't blame her for this too.

404
42:39.840 --> 42:41.780
I hid so much from her.

405
42:43.560 --> 42:45.493
Especially her mother's death.

406
42:46.720 --> 42:48.720
It caused her so much pain.

407
42:49.360 --> 42:51.639
I owe her a debt I can never repay.

408
42:52.528 --> 42:58.180
Whatever comes of all this, I should be the one to bear it.

409
42:58.800 --> 43:00.386
You...

410
43:02.920 --> 43:04.880
But don't worry.

411
43:04.880 --> 43:10.680
If they truly mean to kill you, even if it costs our entire family,

412
43:10.680 --> 43:16.704
even if I have to stage a mutiny, I will get you out of there.

413
43:16.704 --> 43:18.923
No, Father.

414
43:22.160 --> 43:26.360
Using force now would play right into their hands.

415
43:26.360 --> 43:30.023
They don't just want the Yu Army's Arsenal.

416
43:30.023 --> 43:32.500
They want our family's military power.

417
43:34.320 --> 43:40.040
Hold the situation steady for now and leave the rest to me, all right?

418
43:40.040 --> 43:41.221
Trust me.

419
43:46.960 --> 43:48.239
I'm leaving.
